      "role": "user",
      "content": "Right, so it's basically about preventing them from multiplying during that slow-cooling phase. If we see signs of contamination or if a batch has been left out even slightly too long, how should we characterize those specific risks in our audit logs? We need to be very precise about the nature of the threat for our safety compliance reporting.",
